                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The dungeons and enemies are all samey and bland, the view of which leaves much to be desired as the graphics are all samey and bland as well.  No variety makes this rather lackluster.  The movement is slow to boot, as is the character growth, leaving you frustrated with the speed of progression.\n\nThe game presents itself as the complete title, and yet has an in-game store with which to buy DLC that even a Korean gacha game should be ashamed of.\n\nThe controls are, to be kind, absolutely fucking trash and whomsoever made this interface and the choices behind it should be studied so as to better understand and treat mental illness.\n\nWould I, could I recommend this title?  I dare say I could not see a world in which I could ethically recommend this, no.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1789777954,
